# Parcha Translate (ticket #152): translate text on this computer, English <-> Spanish,
# with nothing sent anywhere.
#
#   parchaos-translate [--to en|es] [--json] [TEXT]   translate TEXT (or standard input)
#   parchaos-translate status                         ready | no-engine | no-model
#   parchaos-translate setup                          install the engine (one password prompt)
#                                                     and download the models (checked)
#   parchaos-translate remove                         delete the downloaded models
#
# The models are Opus-MT (Helsinki-NLP, University of Helsinki; Apache-2.0 on their model
# cards, trained on the OPUS corpora), in the ONNX form published by Xenova, pinned to one
# revision with a SHA-256 for every file. They run with Fedora's onnxruntime; the words are
# split with Fedora's sentencepiece. About 115 MB per direction.
